# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv, we recommend adding Pipfile.lock to version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having platform-specific dependencies or
#   dependencies having no cross-platform support, pipenv recommends installing
#   dependencies in a virtualenv.  Do NOT add Pipfile.lock to version control.
Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipenv above, we generally recommend adding poetry.lock to version control.
#   This is especially recommended for binary packages to ensure the lock file
#   contains all the versions that need to be installed.
poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile above, we generally recommend adding pdm.lock to version control.
#   This is especially recommended for binary packages to ensure the lock file
#   contains all the versions that need to be installed.
pdm.lock

# uv
uv.lock

# PEP 582; used by e.g. github.com/David-OConnor/pyflow and github.com/pdm-project/pdm
